WEBVTT

01:41.160 --> 01:42.040
Run!

01:42.080 --> 01:43.420
Don't lose to that cloud!

01:46.180 --> 01:47.340
Let's stop here.

01:47.380 --> 01:48.380
There's no way ahead.

01:48.420 --> 01:50.840
Yingtao, no more white geese.

01:50.880 --> 01:52.340
Let's go back and play games.

01:52.840 --> 01:53.680
I can fly over.

01:54.180 --> 01:55.360
The book says

01:55.400 --> 01:56.640
if you jump hard enough,

01:56.680 --> 01:58.020
and far enough,

01:58.060 --> 01:59.480
wings will grow on your back,

02:00.300 --> 02:01.260
and then…

02:05.900 --> 02:06.860
What are you two doing?

02:07.620 --> 02:09.380
Lin Yingtao, go back now

02:09.419 --> 02:11.280
or I won't let you copy my homework again.

02:11.320 --> 02:12.660
My dad told me

02:12.700 --> 02:14.080
that a real top student's

02:14.120 --> 02:15.720
moving to our construction site soon.

02:15.760 --> 02:16.900
Their family's getting

02:16.940 --> 02:18.180
a unit right next to mine.

02:18.220 --> 02:19.160
So if you cut me off,

02:19.200 --> 02:20.240
I have other options.

02:21.140 --> 02:23.240
Son, we'll arrive at Qunshan soon.

02:24.120 --> 02:25.020
Stop drawing now.

02:25.520 --> 02:28.440
Earlier you weren't feeling well
after eating on the way.

02:28.480 --> 02:29.440
Get some rest.

02:29.940 --> 02:32.080
There's an entrance exam when we arrive.

02:39.480 --> 02:41.060
What's with the dirty coat?

02:42.000 --> 02:43.040
If it's your favorite,

02:43.080 --> 02:44.240
I can get you a new one.

02:47.820 --> 02:49.100
Yingtao, slow down!

02:59.420 --> 03:01.260
Stick. Find a stick.

03:02.540 --> 03:04.280
A startled snake will bite.

03:09.120 --> 03:10.380
That snake jumped

03:11.180 --> 03:12.140
higher than me.

03:12.680 --> 03:13.780
Exactly!

03:13.820 --> 03:15.920
Lin Yingtao,
you really need to grow taller.

03:16.800 --> 03:18.240
Even snakes can jump higher than you.

03:19.680 --> 03:20.760
This is it.

03:20.800 --> 03:22.140
I'm finished!

03:22.180 --> 03:23.020
Yingtao!

03:38.080 --> 03:39.320
I need to use my time wisely

03:39.360 --> 03:40.440
and do something meaningful.

03:40.480 --> 03:42.380
What meaning is there

03:42.420 --> 03:44.080
in helping Cai Fangyuan steal the book?

03:44.120 --> 03:45.340
Of course, it's meaningful.

03:46.280 --> 03:48.020
That novel is mine.

03:48.600 --> 03:50.260
Did you reach it yet?

03:50.300 --> 03:51.520
I'm almost out of strength.

04:35.500 --> 04:36.340
Hello.

04:41.900 --> 04:43.380
Yingtao, where is my book?

04:43.920 --> 04:45.880
- Run.
- Run.

05:07.600 --> 05:08.440
- Mom.
- Hey.

05:08.980 --> 05:10.120
What's wrong, Yingtao?

05:11.440 --> 05:12.520
Mom.

05:12.560 --> 05:13.400
What if…

05:13.440 --> 05:14.800
What if someone

05:14.840 --> 05:16.220
tries to take me away

05:16.260 --> 05:18.220
to a place without you?

05:18.760 --> 05:20.060
Who's trying to take you?

05:20.660 --> 05:21.820
Tell me who you met.

05:21.860 --> 05:23.400
I mean if.

05:23.440 --> 05:25.720
Just like Rapunzel was taken

05:25.760 --> 05:27.300
to another world by a witch.

05:28.380 --> 05:29.500
You're safe.

05:29.540 --> 05:31.340
No one can take you from us.

05:31.380 --> 05:32.500
Juan!

05:33.480 --> 05:35.000
Prepare two more dishes tonight.

05:35.040 --> 05:36.700
- Manager Jiang's here.
- It smells so good.

05:36.740 --> 05:38.480
- Sorry to barge in, Shengjuan.
- Look who's here.

05:38.520 --> 05:39.960
- Manager Jiang.
- Little Yingtao.

05:40.000 --> 05:40.960
Have you gain some weight?

05:41.540 --> 05:42.660
Yingtao.

05:42.700 --> 05:43.540
Say hello.

05:44.680 --> 05:45.560
Manager Jiang.

05:46.120 --> 05:46.960
Come on.

05:47.000 --> 05:48.020
Drink.

05:48.060 --> 05:48.900
Drink!

05:48.940 --> 05:49.900
No.

05:49.940 --> 05:51.040
- Fine.
- Drink slower.

05:51.080 --> 05:52.200
It's okay.

05:52.240 --> 05:53.500
Qiaoxi, you're eating.

05:53.540 --> 05:55.060
Why're you wearing the backpack?

05:55.100 --> 05:56.020
Take it off.

05:56.720 --> 05:57.620
Qiaoxi,

05:57.660 --> 05:59.100
could you take off your backpack?

06:01.860 --> 06:03.060
What's wrong?

06:03.600 --> 06:04.800
Inside his backpack

06:04.840 --> 06:06.020
is a jacket his cousin

06:06.060 --> 06:07.060
from Hong Kong bought him.

06:07.100 --> 06:09.080
It got dirty on the trip here,

06:09.120 --> 06:10.140
so I told him

06:10.180 --> 06:11.280
to toss it,

06:11.320 --> 06:12.380
but he wouldn't.

06:12.420 --> 06:14.140
So he just stuffed it in his bag

06:14.180 --> 06:15.020
and took it here.

06:16.020 --> 06:17.340
It's alright, Qiaoxi.

06:17.380 --> 06:19.060
How about Auntie washes it for you?

06:19.100 --> 06:20.940
By tomorrow when it's dry,
you can wear it again.

06:24.480 --> 06:25.380
Yingtao.

06:26.020 --> 06:27.360
We're out of laundry detergent.

06:27.400 --> 06:28.860
Can you help Mom

06:28.900 --> 06:30.000
buy a pack

06:30.040 --> 06:31.560
from Uncle Qin's shop?

06:36.620 --> 06:39.320
- Uncle Qin, a pack of laundry detergent.
- Hey, Stella.

06:42.020 --> 06:44.240
DAILY GOODS, GROCERIES & CIGARETTES,
CHILDREN'S TOYS, ICE CREAM & SODAS

06:44.280 --> 06:45.840
My dad's out getting supplies.

06:46.340 --> 06:47.300
Lin Yingtao,

06:47.340 --> 06:49.640
I heard you cried over a snake today.

06:49.680 --> 06:51.880
Fell on the ground face down a few times.

06:52.800 --> 06:53.780
Laundry detergent.

07:01.260 --> 07:03.160
Lin Yingtao, I stepped on your shadow.

07:03.200 --> 07:04.240
I won!

07:04.860 --> 07:06.220
I'm too lazy to bother with you.

07:07.080 --> 07:07.980
Is that a surrender?

07:08.520 --> 07:10.380
I met foes that make you look weak.

07:11.260 --> 07:13.220
Can you handle him? How?

07:13.940 --> 07:14.800
I can't.

07:14.840 --> 07:16.720
You're just a bully who picks on the weak.

07:17.580 --> 07:18.700
You don't understand.

07:18.740 --> 07:20.340
He's on another level.

07:20.840 --> 07:22.160
Who cares?

07:22.200 --> 07:23.720
"Enemies aren't for fearing.

07:23.760 --> 07:25.120
They're for fighting."

07:25.160 --> 07:26.540
Your words.

07:26.580 --> 07:28.280
Qin Yeyun. Look over there.

07:29.320 --> 07:30.920
I stepped on your shadow too.

07:30.960 --> 07:32.200
No way I'm losing to you.

07:33.020 --> 07:34.320
Lin Yingtao!

07:39.000 --> 07:40.120
Have a seat.

07:51.420 --> 07:52.680
Want some candies?

07:56.340 --> 07:57.840
Or do you want to
listen to some cassettes?

07:59.400 --> 08:02.180
Give me one cup of Oblivion's brew.

08:03.940 --> 08:06.040
Mickey Mouse. Care to read it?

08:06.080 --> 08:08.420
Everyone loves to read Mickey Mouse.

08:34.220 --> 08:35.580
Chunlu.

08:35.620 --> 08:38.480
For now, just stay
in this little nest of yours.

08:38.980 --> 08:40.159
No wandering off.

08:40.200 --> 08:41.400
Mom's to keep you safe.

08:47.980 --> 08:48.980
Chunlu!

09:02.900 --> 09:04.080
Chunlu.

09:13.260 --> 09:14.360
Let me show you.

09:15.480 --> 09:17.480
Hold it like this first,

09:18.220 --> 09:19.440
then…

09:20.000 --> 09:20.920
pet it…

09:21.420 --> 09:22.420
this way.

10:00.400 --> 10:02.020
Have you found that Qiaoxi

10:02.060 --> 10:03.200
is different from

10:03.240 --> 10:04.460
other children?

10:04.500 --> 10:05.420
Of course.

10:05.920 --> 10:07.440
He is a boy genius on math.

10:07.480 --> 10:08.340
Sure he is different.

10:08.840 --> 10:09.960
I think

10:10.000 --> 10:12.420
he never really moved on
from what happened to his family

10:12.920 --> 10:14.040
decades ago.

10:14.540 --> 10:16.020
Listen, Juan,

10:16.060 --> 10:17.820
let's not bring up

10:17.860 --> 10:19.860
what others avoid discussing.

10:22.100 --> 10:23.800
Manager Jiang has enough on his plate.

10:23.840 --> 10:25.720
We should show this child more compassion.

10:25.760 --> 10:26.600
Okay.

10:28.700 --> 10:30.740
Come on, enough already!

10:32.860 --> 10:33.940
A kid

10:33.980 --> 10:36.060
ate something bad and threw up.

10:36.100 --> 10:37.420
That's normal, right?

10:38.000 --> 10:40.180
He's fine now.

10:40.220 --> 10:41.580
We ate dinner over

10:41.620 --> 10:43.360
at Electrician Lin's,

10:43.400 --> 10:45.280
even played for a bit afterwards.

10:45.960 --> 10:47.620
Alright. Spare me the drama.

11:34.840 --> 11:35.920
Yingtao.

11:35.960 --> 11:37.520
Is that new student next door really

11:37.560 --> 11:38.740
as hardcore as they say?

11:39.340 --> 11:41.100
My dad said that he went to your home,

11:41.140 --> 11:43.040
still grinding homework past midnight.

11:43.080 --> 11:44.120
There's something

11:44.160 --> 11:45.480
I need to come clean about.

11:46.200 --> 11:47.040
What?

11:47.580 --> 11:48.640
That new student,

11:48.680 --> 11:50.420
you must treat him well.

11:50.460 --> 11:52.000
Make sure he feels how friendly

11:52.040 --> 11:53.380
we are at Qunshan Elementary,

11:53.420 --> 11:54.720
and how kind Qunshan people can be.

11:54.760 --> 11:55.600
QUNSHAN POWER PLANT ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

11:55.640 --> 11:57.880
Lin Yingtao, are you serious?

11:57.920 --> 11:59.180
It's his first day,

11:59.220 --> 12:00.140
not a royal visit.

12:00.180 --> 12:01.620
You don't understand.

12:01.660 --> 12:03.500
if he leaves, I leave too.

12:03.540 --> 12:04.380
Where?

12:10.480 --> 12:12.620
Son, the principal

12:12.660 --> 12:14.080
has finally agreed to let you

12:14.120 --> 12:15.480
enroll first and take the test later.

12:16.020 --> 12:17.500
You have to take it seriously,

12:18.340 --> 12:19.580
no more acting out

12:19.620 --> 12:20.660
when the time comes.

12:30.300 --> 12:32.200
Two tiger moms,

12:32.240 --> 12:33.700
two tiger moms,

12:33.740 --> 12:35.780
Fighting hard,

12:35.820 --> 12:37.920
fighting hard!

12:37.960 --> 12:39.940
One lost her ears,

12:39.980 --> 12:41.960
one lost her tail,

12:42.000 --> 12:45.820
- How bizarre!
- Are you idiot?

12:45.860 --> 12:46.700
You beat me first!

12:46.740 --> 12:47.740
What's this?

12:47.780 --> 12:49.060
Who's causing chaos?

12:50.640 --> 12:52.820
Lin Qile, stop messing around!

12:53.880 --> 12:55.960
Class has begun! Back to your seat!

12:56.000 --> 12:57.940
They even renamed you as "Qile",

12:57.980 --> 12:59.380
why can't you bring some joy?

13:01.400 --> 13:02.900
First day of school…

13:11.620 --> 13:13.540
This whole area is staff housing,

13:13.580 --> 13:14.680
ours included.

13:15.360 --> 13:17.540
Du Shang lives here too, in the

13:18.040 --> 13:19.400
single-occupancy dorm with his mom.

13:20.520 --> 13:22.380
His dad got transferred

13:22.420 --> 13:24.180
to the Pucheng construction site.

13:24.680 --> 13:26.320
Every time Uncle Du comes back,

13:26.360 --> 13:28.500
Du Shang gets moody for days.

13:28.540 --> 13:31.520
Probably upset Uncle Du
never brings gifts.

13:32.400 --> 13:34.160
That's Qin Yeyun's place.

13:34.200 --> 13:36.940
She's the person I hate most
in the whole world.

13:36.980 --> 13:39.180
She's got that clap-strike palm,
hits like a truck.

13:40.540 --> 13:41.800
But she's so pretty.

13:42.440 --> 13:44.660
Yu Qiao says we're
"two sides of the same coin".

13:44.700 --> 13:46.060
She's the bad side.

13:46.100 --> 13:47.060
I'm the shiny one.

13:49.680 --> 13:51.920
She lives with her dad.

13:51.960 --> 13:53.440
Ever seen him?

13:53.480 --> 13:55.220
Uncle Qin, who runs the kiosk.

13:55.720 --> 13:58.060
He got work injuries years ago,

13:58.100 --> 13:59.740
leaving him inconvenience of only one leg.

14:00.240 --> 14:01.580
Cai Fangyuan's dad let him

14:01.620 --> 14:03.720
take over the worksite concession stand.

14:03.760 --> 14:05.520
Uncle Qin is amazing.

14:05.560 --> 14:07.400
He does qigong every day to heal his leg.

14:10.420 --> 14:12.100
This is Yu Qiao's place,

14:12.140 --> 14:13.180
your deskmate.

14:13.220 --> 14:15.420
Sick dunk! That was legit!

14:15.460 --> 14:17.180
He lives with his dad,

14:17.220 --> 14:18.900
mom, grandma,

14:18.940 --> 14:21.000
and his little cousin Yu Jin.

14:22.060 --> 14:23.480
Yu Jin's mother fell ill,

14:23.520 --> 14:25.840
so she sent him to stay with them.

14:25.880 --> 14:27.940
Truth is, the Yu family's place
is already packed,

14:27.980 --> 14:29.520
no room to spare.

14:30.060 --> 14:31.560
But Uncle Yu is a Model Worker,

14:31.600 --> 14:33.280
the site's most respected veteran.

14:33.320 --> 14:34.680
He'd never say no to anyone.

14:35.860 --> 14:38.080
Next door to Yu Qiao's place
lives Cai Fangyuan,

14:38.120 --> 14:41.100
with his mom and dad.

14:41.140 --> 14:43.220
He's all about good food,

14:43.260 --> 14:44.680
fun games, and cool stuff.

14:45.460 --> 14:46.640
Auntie Kang's a killer cook,

14:46.680 --> 14:48.680
while Uncle Cai's a stock market whiz.

14:48.720 --> 14:51.240
They hope he can study hard,

14:51.280 --> 14:52.680
crack a top-tier university.

14:52.720 --> 14:53.700
BRUTE MOTO

14:54.620 --> 14:56.940
There's a bird's nest
up that big locust tree.

14:56.980 --> 14:59.300
Two years ago, a baby bird fell from it.

14:59.340 --> 15:00.200
I took it home,

15:00.240 --> 15:01.360
and my dad actually

15:01.400 --> 15:02.700
nursed it back to life.

15:03.200 --> 15:04.040
Well,

15:04.080 --> 15:06.440
the tree blooms with sweet white flowers
in spring.

15:06.480 --> 15:08.480
Mom used to make the best
steamed rice with them.

15:08.980 --> 15:11.180
The field in the west
still grows so many dandelions,

15:11.680 --> 15:13.300
but I've never liked them.

15:13.340 --> 15:14.500
They scatter easily.

15:21.280 --> 15:22.280
They say

15:22.780 --> 15:24.500
when someone goes to the other side,

15:25.000 --> 15:27.120
they forget everything from this life.

15:27.740 --> 15:29.200
I don't want to forget them,

15:29.840 --> 15:31.460
forget anything about Qunshan.

15:32.740 --> 15:34.480
Will you remember it all for me?

15:34.980 --> 15:36.160
If I forget,

15:36.200 --> 15:37.360
then you tell me.

15:38.660 --> 15:39.680
Doesn't remembering

15:40.680 --> 15:41.560
hurt even more?

15:41.600 --> 15:42.880
I'm not scared of pain.

15:42.920 --> 15:44.820
I don't even cry getting an injection.

15:45.840 --> 15:46.940
I just…

15:47.440 --> 15:49.620
I don't know if Mom and Dad

15:49.660 --> 15:52.040
will still love me after I die.

15:54.080 --> 15:55.100
Yes.

15:56.340 --> 15:58.200
They'll remember you always.

15:58.700 --> 15:59.840
And keep loving only you.

16:00.380 --> 16:01.240
How do you konw?

16:03.180 --> 16:04.560
The dead

16:05.280 --> 16:06.600
will always be loved.

16:10.960 --> 16:12.420
You changed your mind?

16:12.460 --> 16:14.040
You don't take me away?

16:14.640 --> 16:16.260
I'm not who you think I am.

16:16.760 --> 16:18.160
I can't take you with me.

16:21.040 --> 16:21.960
What about you?

16:22.000 --> 16:23.340
Are you leaving?

16:23.380 --> 16:24.880
I'll leave one day.

16:41.620 --> 16:43.900
I love my friends so much.

16:43.940 --> 16:47.400
Lately, even Qin Yeyun is kinda cute.

16:47.440 --> 16:49.000
If it's possible,

16:49.040 --> 16:50.220
maybe one day,

16:50.260 --> 16:52.560
we could've been close.

16:52.600 --> 16:53.960
I really hope

16:54.000 --> 16:56.960
I could stay at
Power Plant Elementary forever.

16:57.500 --> 16:59.000
Unfortunately,

16:59.040 --> 17:00.440
I'm going to die soon.

17:07.460 --> 17:08.300
Yingtao.

17:09.500 --> 17:11.520
Give them all away?

17:12.099 --> 17:13.920
Even your favorites, just let them go?

17:14.480 --> 17:17.800
But this? No, this stays.

17:20.740 --> 17:22.119
My god.

17:22.160 --> 17:23.000
Qiaoxi,

17:23.040 --> 17:24.839
do you know what's happened?

17:27.119 --> 17:28.660
She left it all behind.

17:29.240 --> 17:31.940
QUNSHAN POWER PLANT ELEMENTARY SCHOOL

17:36.500 --> 17:38.920
Lin Yingtao!

17:40.240 --> 17:41.400
Miss Zhang.

17:41.440 --> 17:42.620
Yingtao's mom.

17:42.660 --> 17:44.540
Look at what Yingtao wrote.
What does this mean?

17:44.580 --> 17:46.100
- Where is she?
- In the house.

17:46.140 --> 17:47.140
Miss Zhang.

17:48.320 --> 17:49.160
- Lin Qile.
- Miss Zhang.

17:49.200 --> 17:51.220
Are you okay?

17:52.280 --> 17:53.820
- What's wrong?
- Yingtao.

17:53.860 --> 17:55.260
What's wrong with you?

17:55.300 --> 17:57.100
Why would you write
that you're going to die soon?

17:57.960 --> 18:00.600
I'm really dying.

18:01.140 --> 18:02.340
What happened?

18:07.220 --> 18:09.280
Don't cry, just talk to me.

18:09.780 --> 18:11.280
Take your time.

18:12.020 --> 18:13.180
Everyone says

18:13.220 --> 18:14.920
if you meet a snake

18:14.960 --> 18:16.980
that stands up to compare heights,

18:17.020 --> 18:18.420
you must run.

18:18.960 --> 18:19.800
Because

18:19.840 --> 18:21.820
if you lose,

18:21.860 --> 18:23.500
you'll die.

18:23.540 --> 18:25.080
And I lost.

18:25.120 --> 18:26.140
That snake reared so high,

18:26.180 --> 18:28.300
it towered over me.

18:28.900 --> 18:30.640
You little girl, you scared me to death.

18:30.680 --> 18:33.340
Miss Zhang, I'm telling the truth.

18:33.380 --> 18:36.020
If you don't believe me,
ask Cai Fangyuan and the others.

18:36.060 --> 18:37.340
They saw it too.

18:38.440 --> 18:40.440
So Cai Fangyuan was the one

18:40.480 --> 18:42.620
who told you about the "death game"?

18:42.660 --> 18:43.700
No.

18:43.740 --> 18:45.140
Cai Fangyuan's way too dumb.

18:45.180 --> 18:47.400
It was Brother Chen Minghao who told me.

18:48.260 --> 18:49.980
That Chen Minghao used to

18:50.020 --> 18:52.380
live next door,
where Qiaoxi's family is now.

18:52.420 --> 18:54.960
But after he got into a middle school
in the provincial capital,

18:55.000 --> 18:56.000
they moved away.

18:56.980 --> 18:58.880
Look at you,

18:58.920 --> 18:59.920
you silly little thing.

18:59.960 --> 19:00.960
Yingtao.

19:01.000 --> 19:02.440
Do you trust Teacher?

19:03.940 --> 19:07.320
Our dear Lin Qile is
absolutely not going to die.

19:07.360 --> 19:09.300
This whole "measuring heights" thing is

19:09.340 --> 19:11.500
total nonsense. I promise.

19:12.060 --> 19:12.900
All right.

19:13.400 --> 19:14.480
It's okay.

19:19.320 --> 19:20.840
The teacher said

19:20.880 --> 19:22.840
we need to resubmit
the transfer application.

19:25.180 --> 19:26.840
Wasn't this already signed before?

19:27.380 --> 19:29.060
September 30th is not my birthday.

19:33.600 --> 19:34.500
I'll rewrite it.

19:41.040 --> 19:42.840
TRANSFER APPLICATION

19:50.020 --> 19:50.980
Hello.

19:53.280 --> 19:54.840
I'm sending Qiaoxi to school.

19:55.340 --> 19:58.880
TRANSFER APPLICATION
DATE OF BIRTH JANUARY 26TH

19:58.920 --> 20:00.420
Okay, then I know.

20:12.200 --> 20:13.300
Your mom called.

20:13.340 --> 20:15.240
She said she's coming over this afternoon

20:15.280 --> 20:16.400
to have dinner with you.

20:16.440 --> 20:18.420
I'll pick you up after school.

20:20.200 --> 20:22.380
Son, good luck

20:22.420 --> 20:23.260
on your entrance exam!

20:25.120 --> 20:27.140
- Go on now.
- Bye.

20:30.040 --> 20:31.200
Lin Yingtao.

20:31.240 --> 20:33.320
now that you know you're not gonna die,

20:33.360 --> 20:35.740
why are you still
helping Cai Fangyuan steal the book?

20:35.780 --> 20:37.640
This hardly counts as self-sacrifice.

20:38.600 --> 20:40.560
Yingtao's helping me steal the book

20:40.600 --> 20:42.360
out of pure loyalty to friends.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.580
Death has nothing to do with it.

20:44.240 --> 20:45.480
Charge forth, Yingtao,

20:45.520 --> 20:46.720
my heroine.

20:46.760 --> 20:48.360
Charge forth, heroine.

20:48.400 --> 20:51.820
So you gave the new one a grand tour
of the Qunshan worksite yesterday?

20:52.320 --> 20:54.140
Thought you were all
about "being nice to him"?

20:54.180 --> 20:56.760
Thought you'd follow him anywhere?

20:57.520 --> 20:59.320
How's that warm welcome
working out for you?

20:59.840 --> 21:01.720
Yu Qiao, you're being so rude.

21:02.220 --> 21:03.380
He's actually really nice.

21:54.480 --> 21:56.520
It hurts. Be gentle.

21:56.560 --> 21:59.080
- Don't move. If it hurts, tough it out.
- Qing Yeyun.

21:59.620 --> 22:01.300
Are you getting revenge right now?

22:01.340 --> 22:03.700
I paid you ten comic books for this.

22:03.740 --> 22:05.640
If Mom weren't on duty today,

22:05.680 --> 22:07.080
I'd never let you touch my hair.

22:07.120 --> 22:08.340
This is highway robbery.

22:51.660 --> 22:58.460
UNITY, CIVILITY, DILIGENCE, INNOVATION

23:18.800 --> 23:20.220
This essay topic's easy.

23:20.260 --> 23:21.980
My original name was Lin Yingtao

23:22.480 --> 23:25.160
because Mom craved cherries
when she was pregnant with me.

23:25.660 --> 23:26.900
But when I started school,

23:26.940 --> 23:28.320
they said names should be meaningful,

23:28.360 --> 23:29.580
not just simple,

23:29.620 --> 23:31.400
so now I'm Lin Qile.

23:32.040 --> 23:33.600
Thank goodness what your mom craved

23:33.640 --> 23:35.380
was not garlic or sweet potatoes.

23:35.420 --> 23:37.680
Or you'd be Lin Sweetpotato or Lin Garlic.

23:38.920 --> 23:41.320
Lin Yingtao's crazy again.

23:48.420 --> 23:50.940
The Qiao in my name means Woodsman.

23:50.980 --> 23:52.920
Dad named me after characters
from Jin Yong's novels.

23:52.960 --> 23:54.240
My "Fangyuan",

23:54.280 --> 23:56.280
Square Fang, Dollar Yuan.

23:56.320 --> 23:58.040
I'm gonna print money with this name.

23:58.540 --> 24:00.460
There's an artist called Duchamp.

24:00.500 --> 24:02.320
Mom figured since
we share the surname "Du",

24:02.360 --> 24:03.700
why not name me "Du Shang" too?

24:04.240 --> 24:05.400
Jiang Qiaoxi.

24:05.440 --> 24:07.320
What's your name supposed to mean?

24:08.500 --> 24:09.660
Nothing special.

24:09.700 --> 24:11.080
Your name is this cool,

24:11.120 --> 24:12.160
and it doesn't mean anything?

24:12.200 --> 24:13.960
It really doesn't mean anything.

24:27.900 --> 24:28.920
- Here.
- Clear a spot.

24:28.960 --> 24:30.260
Shengjuan, stop busying yourself.

24:30.800 --> 24:32.180
There are already enough dishes.

24:32.220 --> 24:33.560
It's okay. Here.

24:34.160 --> 24:35.840
Alright then. You know,

24:35.880 --> 24:38.400
I was originally going
to entrust Qiaoxi to your family,

24:38.440 --> 24:39.500
but now I'm entrusting

24:39.540 --> 24:41.100
myself to your family as well.

24:42.420 --> 24:43.840
Manager Jiang, help yourself.

24:43.880 --> 24:45.220
Just some simple dishes.

24:45.260 --> 24:46.940
"Just some simple dishes"?
This is a feast.

24:46.980 --> 24:49.480
But Juan's cooking is good.

24:49.520 --> 24:50.700
- Absolutely delicious!
- Delicious.

24:50.740 --> 24:52.080
This beats restaurant food.

24:53.080 --> 24:54.100
Uncle Jiang,

24:54.140 --> 24:56.300
what does "Qiaoxi"
in Jiang Qiaoxi's name mean?

24:57.480 --> 24:59.400
You've really stumped me.

24:59.440 --> 25:00.320
I actually don't know

25:00.360 --> 25:02.020
what does "Qiaoxi" mean.

25:02.620 --> 25:04.400
When Hongfei and I had him,

25:04.440 --> 25:05.520
we weren't mentally prepared.

25:06.280 --> 25:07.140
Then came

25:07.180 --> 25:08.180
the birth certificate.

25:08.220 --> 25:09.700
- We had to pick a name.
- Right.

25:09.740 --> 25:11.080
I was sweating bullets

25:11.120 --> 25:12.260
until I spotted

25:12.300 --> 25:14.240
a line of poetry

25:14.280 --> 25:15.220
in the newspaper

25:15.260 --> 25:17.320
"Gates and homes glow
at the west of Jiangqiao's crest."

25:17.360 --> 25:18.740
So "Jiang Qiaoxi" it was.

25:21.080 --> 25:22.540
Just one of those coincidences.

25:22.580 --> 25:23.420
You were right.

25:23.960 --> 25:25.460
It doesn't mean anything special.

25:25.500 --> 25:27.780
Now this essay's gonna be a pain to write.

25:27.820 --> 25:29.860
- Just some simple home cooking.
- Sure.

25:29.900 --> 25:30.760
Thanks.

25:33.840 --> 25:35.580
Want a Coke?

25:37.780 --> 25:38.940
Or maybe a Jianlibao?

25:39.480 --> 25:40.780
How about peanut milk?

25:40.820 --> 25:42.280
That's my favorite. So good.

25:44.040 --> 25:45.560
Don't you need to study?

25:51.360 --> 25:52.760
Do you want to hug Chunlu?

26:02.200 --> 26:03.380
I heard that

26:03.420 --> 26:06.840
the child of Manager Jiang
who passed away was named Jiang Mengchu.

26:07.720 --> 26:09.020
When he was named,

26:09.060 --> 26:10.800
they spent two or three months
thinking about it.

26:11.640 --> 26:14.640
He got into the GATE Program
from Chinese Academy of Sciences at 13.

26:14.680 --> 26:16.580
Everyone called him a prodigy.

26:17.120 --> 26:19.340
But aren't all children
flesh of your flesh?

26:19.840 --> 26:22.300
How could they favor one so blatantly?

26:22.340 --> 26:23.680
After they lost their first child

26:24.180 --> 26:25.080
and nearly divorced,

26:25.800 --> 26:27.100
the higher-ups said they should

26:27.760 --> 26:28.700
try for another.

26:29.200 --> 26:30.240
The idea was that

26:30.280 --> 26:32.280
a new baby

26:32.320 --> 26:33.300
might bring hope,

26:33.340 --> 26:35.360
maybe even patch up their marriage.

26:35.860 --> 26:37.220
Seemed like a good plan.

26:37.260 --> 26:39.220
The kid's nine now,

26:39.260 --> 26:40.660
turning out so well.

26:41.180 --> 26:43.100
How can both of them just not care?

26:43.140 --> 26:44.120
Too busy, obviously.

26:44.880 --> 26:46.680
How many times have we seen his mom?

26:49.460 --> 26:50.680
GRAND CHINESE DICTIONARY

26:56.880 --> 27:01.640
QIAO

27:06.380 --> 27:08.600
Bunny dear, be good

27:08.640 --> 27:13.400
and open the door. I'd like to go in.

27:15.860 --> 27:16.740
You silly thing!

27:16.780 --> 27:18.480
Why'd you listen so literally?

27:18.520 --> 27:19.740
What if I'm a bad guy?

27:20.540 --> 27:21.940
I have to do my homework.

27:23.820 --> 27:25.460
Who needs homework anyway?

27:25.960 --> 27:26.860
I'm taking you somewhere.

27:40.100 --> 27:43.320
Sorry, it's raining. My bad.

27:43.860 --> 27:44.960
I should check beforehand.

27:45.000 --> 27:46.280
Lin Yingtao.

27:46.780 --> 27:48.000
What's in your mind?

27:48.860 --> 27:49.880
Qiáo,

27:49.920 --> 27:50.780
in Grand Chinese Dictionary

27:51.320 --> 27:52.900
page 795,

27:52.940 --> 27:54.180
the 20th character in list.

27:54.220 --> 27:56.080
Radical mountain
with nine strokes in total.

27:56.120 --> 27:59.280
A polyphonic character. When read as Jiào,

27:59.320 --> 28:00.860
it means "mountain path".

28:00.900 --> 28:03.580
As Qiáo, "a peak, high and sharp".

28:04.080 --> 28:06.040
Qiaoxi. Here, west of the highest,

28:06.080 --> 28:08.240
sharpest summit in the Qunshan range.

28:08.280 --> 28:10.560
I once saw the most
breathtaking sunset clouds here.

28:11.100 --> 28:12.600
Crimson, blazing, glorious.

28:13.420 --> 28:15.740
I think that's what your name was meant.

28:16.740 --> 28:17.900
But now…

28:18.680 --> 28:20.640
Now it rains.

28:21.140 --> 28:22.320
And nothing can be seen.

28:23.260 --> 28:25.440
Then tell me the most beautiful sunset

28:25.480 --> 28:27.040
you have ever seen here.

28:27.640 --> 28:28.920
Then I'll tell you.

28:28.960 --> 28:31.140
That sunset burned like wildfire.

28:31.640 --> 28:33.980
Its shapes and hues morphing so wildly.

28:34.640 --> 28:36.480
I could never guess what it would

28:36.520 --> 28:38.020
look like in the next minute.

28:38.900 --> 28:40.620
Did it ever look like a rabbit?

28:40.660 --> 28:42.060
Yes.

28:42.100 --> 28:44.580
There was a rabbit
right beside the sun, running,

28:44.620 --> 28:47.240
with amber clutched in its paws.

28:47.280 --> 28:48.160
Did you see it too?

28:54.780 --> 28:55.660
You are right.

28:56.200 --> 28:57.960
There is indeed a rabbit running.

28:58.500 --> 28:59.840
I didn't lie to you, did I?

29:00.680 --> 29:02.840
I told you "Jiang Qiaoxi" is perfect,

29:03.380 --> 29:04.880
meaningful and lovely to say.

29:04.920 --> 29:07.620
Jiang Qiaoxi!

29:08.120 --> 29:10.260
You see, every time
I call out Jiang Qiaoxi,

29:10.300 --> 29:11.700
I will laugh.

29:12.220 --> 29:15.260
Jiang Qiaoxi!

29:15.840 --> 29:19.100
Jiang Qiaoxi!

29:38.580 --> 29:40.820
Bro, Sis-in-law, let me show you this.

29:40.860 --> 29:42.300
See these test reports?

29:43.500 --> 29:44.540
The key point is:

29:44.580 --> 29:46.560
it's completely non-toxic.

29:46.600 --> 29:49.380
With our little Yingtao being so young,

29:49.420 --> 29:50.380
eating all those

29:50.420 --> 29:52.060
veggies and fruits,

29:52.560 --> 29:54.420
pesticides would be disastrous.

29:55.840 --> 29:56.800
Absolutely disastrous.

30:00.380 --> 30:02.840
I kinda forgot the rest,

30:02.880 --> 30:05.080
but they swear this stuff is drinkable.

30:05.120 --> 30:07.020
I'll chug half the bottle myself.
It's safe.

30:07.060 --> 30:08.280
I have confidence.

30:08.320 --> 30:09.940
- No need.
- It's okay.

30:09.980 --> 30:11.980
- It's okay.
- Don't spill it.

30:12.020 --> 30:13.420
Wang Yu, don't drink it.

30:13.460 --> 30:15.760
It's not only non-toxic and harmless,

30:15.800 --> 30:17.720
- but also has a good cleaning…
- Uncle Wang.

30:18.380 --> 30:19.780
- Yingtao, you're back.
- Yingtao's back.

30:19.820 --> 30:22.020
Uncle Wang, where have you been?

30:22.060 --> 30:25.340
When you're gone, no one plays
"The Cow on the High Mountain" with me.

30:26.120 --> 30:27.700
Then let's play. Come on.

30:28.200 --> 30:31.180
On the high mountain stands a cow,

30:31.220 --> 30:33.820
Two curved horns upon its brow,

30:33.860 --> 30:36.340
Four hooves split eight ways neat,

30:36.380 --> 30:38.920
Tail out back, what a feat!

30:39.800 --> 30:41.080
Out back!

30:41.920 --> 30:43.180
Out back!

30:43.220 --> 30:44.100
Yingtao.

30:44.140 --> 30:45.160
Stop pestering your uncle.

30:45.200 --> 30:46.200
Go wash your hands and eat.

30:46.240 --> 30:47.880
Go, Yingtao.

30:48.380 --> 30:49.380
Uncle,

30:49.420 --> 30:51.440
are you having dinner here today?

30:51.480 --> 30:53.080
I'll eat faster than you this time.

30:53.740 --> 30:54.580
Of course.

30:54.620 --> 30:56.480
Your uncle will have dinner with us.

30:56.520 --> 30:57.620
Food's ready.

30:59.160 --> 31:02.300
Brother, Sis-in-law, I won't eat here.

31:02.340 --> 31:04.200
I have a lot of things to do.
I'm very busy.

31:09.800 --> 31:10.820
Wang Yu.

31:12.380 --> 31:15.400
- Wang Yu, we'll grab three bottles.
- Shall we eat?

31:15.440 --> 31:16.520
- I think it's good.
- Come.

31:16.560 --> 31:17.660
We'll give it a try.

31:18.700 --> 31:19.740
Well…

31:19.780 --> 31:20.760
Well…

31:25.600 --> 31:26.920
Stay for lunch.

31:26.960 --> 31:28.100
Let's eat together.

31:30.580 --> 31:32.500
This can be engraved with patterns.

31:33.240 --> 31:35.160
Where is Du Shang?

31:35.200 --> 31:36.820
We literally agreed

31:36.860 --> 31:39.400
to go up the mountain together,
early birthday for Qiaoxi,

31:39.440 --> 31:40.480
gifts ready.

31:40.980 --> 31:43.020
Is Du Shang's surprise
just not showing up?

31:43.060 --> 31:44.880
Cao Shuangyan,
what the hell is your problem?

31:44.920 --> 31:45.840
How could you do this?

31:45.880 --> 31:46.920
I've been breaking my back out there,

31:46.960 --> 31:48.340
finally come home.

31:48.380 --> 31:49.740
- The pork trotters won't even soften!
- Stop!

31:49.780 --> 31:51.120
You just don't want me back.

31:51.160 --> 31:51.840
- Right?
- Don't do this!

31:51.880 --> 31:53.940
It's because the gas tank is empty.

31:53.980 --> 31:55.840
Why does this always happen
when you come back?

31:55.880 --> 31:56.700
The gas tank's empty.

31:56.740 --> 31:58.280
Her brain is empty too?
Why not replace it?

31:58.320 --> 32:00.200
- Can you calm down?
- Dad.

32:00.240 --> 32:02.160
Dad, please stop hitting Mom.

32:02.200 --> 32:03.440
She's bleeding.

32:03.480 --> 32:04.540
You're still taking her side?

32:04.580 --> 32:06.080
Do you know who puts food on this table?

32:06.120 --> 32:07.040
You father, me!

32:07.080 --> 32:08.160
Get out of my face!

32:08.200 --> 32:09.360
What are you doing?

32:09.400 --> 32:10.480
Du Yongchun!

32:10.520 --> 32:12.200
- What are you doing?
- Did you teach him to say that?

32:12.240 --> 32:13.120
What are you doing?

32:13.160 --> 32:14.420
- I will beat you…
- Stop!

32:14.460 --> 32:15.340
- Hey stop!
- Stop!

32:17.180 --> 32:18.200
- Get off!
- Mom!

32:18.240 --> 32:19.360
Your medical expenses

32:19.400 --> 32:21.240
will be deducted from his bonus.

32:22.200 --> 32:23.300
Don't worry.

32:28.780 --> 32:30.600
Du Yongchun,
you'd better explain yourself.

32:30.640 --> 32:31.700
Why did you hit your wife?

32:32.200 --> 32:33.360
How did she deserve that?

32:35.700 --> 32:37.120
Manager Jiang, I drank too much.

32:43.740 --> 32:48.620
QUNSHAN NO.2 HOSPITAL

32:48.660 --> 32:49.500
Here's what we'll do.

32:49.540 --> 32:51.940
Divide Du Yongchun's wages
in three portions.

32:51.980 --> 32:53.400
Two portions sent home to his family,

32:53.440 --> 32:55.400
one kept for himself.

32:56.140 --> 32:58.460
And notify the worksite foreman,

32:58.500 --> 32:59.920
tell him I authorized this.

33:00.740 --> 33:01.900
Good, settled.

33:02.400 --> 33:03.240
Qiaoxi.

33:04.140 --> 33:04.980
Come here.

33:06.240 --> 33:07.720
Your birthday's coming up.

33:07.760 --> 33:09.620
Daddy got you a present.

33:12.320 --> 33:13.220
Do you like it?

33:14.460 --> 33:15.780
Black again.

33:17.220 --> 33:18.860
Mom chose it,

33:18.900 --> 33:19.840
or you?

33:22.080 --> 33:24.480
Your mom and I decided together.

33:25.480 --> 33:26.760
Black suits you.

33:26.800 --> 33:27.640
It's a classic look

33:27.680 --> 33:29.240
for a young man.

33:39.280 --> 33:40.280
Qiaoxi.

33:43.280 --> 33:45.300
Dad's swamped with work lately,

33:45.340 --> 33:46.520
so I can't take you there.

33:47.080 --> 33:48.800
The day after tomorrow,
Mom will pick you up.

34:08.239 --> 34:11.320
Happy birthday to you

34:11.360 --> 34:14.179
Happy birthday to you

34:14.719 --> 34:17.760
Happy birthday to you

34:17.800 --> 34:21.120
Happy birthday to you

34:21.620 --> 34:22.520
Jiang Qiaoxi.

34:22.560 --> 34:25.520
Happy birthday to you.

34:29.739 --> 34:32.699
I started collecting these flowers
before winter came.

34:32.739 --> 34:34.460
Mom helped me dry them,

34:34.500 --> 34:35.880
preserved forever,

34:35.920 --> 34:37.880
never to wilt.

34:38.460 --> 34:40.639
But since you love black,

34:40.679 --> 34:43.080
and I've never seen
black flowers in Qunshan.

34:43.620 --> 34:45.239
I dyed them with ink.

34:45.780 --> 34:46.940
Do you think

34:46.980 --> 34:48.100
black looks good?

34:48.139 --> 34:50.380
We don't really like so much black.

34:50.880 --> 34:53.020
But you wear black every day.

34:53.060 --> 34:55.699
Your pencil case, pen, water bottle,

34:55.739 --> 34:57.780
even your eraser all black.

34:57.820 --> 34:59.600
We've never seen

34:59.640 --> 35:00.700
so much black

35:00.740 --> 35:02.140
on one person before.

35:02.800 --> 35:04.740
But Lin Yingtao said,

35:05.240 --> 35:06.380
if you like someone,

35:06.420 --> 35:07.600
you should accept them

35:07.640 --> 35:09.240
just as they are.

35:09.740 --> 35:11.560
I don't mean that kind of likes.

35:11.600 --> 35:12.960
Which kind of likes?

35:13.460 --> 35:14.460
You…

35:15.160 --> 35:16.200
I like it.

35:20.600 --> 35:22.960
Then you can make a statement.

35:27.360 --> 35:28.340
Thank you all.

35:28.380 --> 35:29.860
SMILE, GOOD

35:29.900 --> 35:31.580
Jiang Qiaoxi, make a wish.

35:34.260 --> 35:35.500
Jiang Qiaoxi.

35:37.100 --> 35:38.220
Happy birthday to you.

35:38.260 --> 35:40.740
Du Shang, you're just in time.

35:40.780 --> 35:42.040
We're at the wishing part.

35:42.080 --> 35:43.060
Hurry up.

35:45.060 --> 35:46.140
We've been waiting for you.

35:46.180 --> 35:47.620
It wouldn't be the same without you.

35:49.120 --> 35:49.960
Jiang Qiaoxi.

35:50.680 --> 35:51.880
Happy birthday to you.

35:53.680 --> 35:54.620
Du Shang.

35:55.380 --> 35:56.560
I want to give you

35:57.260 --> 35:58.260
this wish.

35:58.800 --> 35:59.980
Please make a wish.

36:08.700 --> 36:09.600
Quickly.

36:33.500 --> 36:35.040
Jiang Qiaoxi,

36:35.080 --> 36:36.620
never forget

36:36.660 --> 36:37.640
this is your home.

36:37.680 --> 36:38.980
You must come back to us soon.

36:40.300 --> 36:41.220
Yingtao.

36:41.780 --> 36:42.700
Thanks.

36:43.800 --> 36:44.760
Don't thank me.

36:44.800 --> 36:45.640
You're pretty great.

36:46.280 --> 36:48.600
You even gave your birthday wish
to Du Shang.

36:49.100 --> 36:51.220
Who does that?

36:52.980 --> 36:54.840
Anyway, my wish

36:54.880 --> 36:55.920
never came true.

36:58.540 --> 37:01.460
What's your wish?
I'll help you realize it.

37:02.000 --> 37:03.340
Actually…

37:05.340 --> 37:06.400
I don't like black,

37:07.840 --> 37:10.300
but I like the gifts you gave me.

37:10.800 --> 37:11.920
Today,

37:11.960 --> 37:13.280
I like black for the first time.

37:13.320 --> 37:15.240
You don't like black,

37:15.740 --> 37:17.740
then why are all

37:17.780 --> 37:19.140
your clothes, your things black?

37:19.960 --> 37:21.420
The one who likes black

37:22.060 --> 37:23.400
is my brother.

37:24.760 --> 37:26.980
These are the things they bought for me.

37:27.480 --> 37:29.160
They controls and makes me like the color.

37:29.900 --> 37:31.040
I can only like black.

37:32.960 --> 37:35.040
They won't love me for who I am.

37:38.200 --> 37:39.900
So what color do you like?

37:40.720 --> 37:41.960
I didn't think about it,

37:43.300 --> 37:44.320
but

37:44.820 --> 37:45.920
I start to like black.

37:49.520 --> 37:51.800
What else? You can think of something else

37:51.840 --> 37:53.080
and then you will like it.

37:57.500 --> 37:58.600
Red.

37:58.640 --> 37:59.900
I like red.

38:02.120 --> 38:03.040
Jiang Qiaoxi.

38:03.540 --> 38:05.720
When it comes to my birthday,

38:05.760 --> 38:06.600
I'll make a wish for you.

38:07.440 --> 38:09.640
I wish your parents
will love you just the way you are,

38:09.680 --> 38:10.720
okay?

38:12.160 --> 38:13.480
What about you?

38:14.820 --> 38:15.960
What is your wish?

38:19.580 --> 38:21.040
My wish is

38:22.500 --> 38:24.740
that we all stay together

38:25.240 --> 38:26.540
and never leave.

38:27.600 --> 38:29.320
Then keep your wish.

38:30.480 --> 38:31.680
That is more important

38:32.180 --> 38:33.340
to me.

38:48.340 --> 38:51.020
GO TO WORK HAPPILY, RETURN HOME SAFELY.

39:13.060 --> 39:14.740
Qiaoxi, could you get the door?

39:17.000 --> 39:18.340
Yingtao, you're here.

39:18.380 --> 39:20.020
Uncle Jiang,

39:20.060 --> 39:22.060
I bought some fresh shrimp baozi,
would you like some?

39:22.100 --> 39:23.160
Yes.

39:23.860 --> 39:25.000
No.

39:25.040 --> 39:26.680
You can take it back and eat it yourself.

39:26.720 --> 39:27.820
Thank you.

39:29.720 --> 39:32.080
Yingtao, bring it in. Come in.

39:32.120 --> 39:33.400
Bring it in for you to eat?

39:33.440 --> 39:35.720
Who knows what kind of meat
they put in street baozi?

39:38.080 --> 39:39.120
Thank you,

39:39.160 --> 39:40.260
little girl,

39:40.300 --> 39:42.140
but we don't eat street food.

39:43.100 --> 39:44.780
Qiaoxi, close the door.

39:45.320 --> 39:46.620
You're letting the cold air in.

40:04.540 --> 40:06.740
Don't let Yingtao know about this.

40:07.860 --> 40:09.820
Tell her after school starts.

40:10.320 --> 40:12.600
Maybe after not seeing each other
all winter break,

40:12.640 --> 40:14.880
hearing the news will hurt a little less.

40:15.400 --> 40:16.560
It may not be better

40:17.060 --> 40:18.260
after the winter break.

40:18.760 --> 40:20.240
What do you suggest we do then?

40:20.740 --> 40:22.240
This kid

40:22.780 --> 40:25.440
was transferred here and there, on a whim.

40:36.860 --> 40:38.560
Dad, Mom,

40:39.100 --> 40:41.860
who are you saying is transferring away?

40:42.980 --> 40:44.020
It's not Jiang Qiaoxi, right?

40:44.860 --> 40:46.840
He promised he'd come back
after winter break.

40:47.420 --> 40:48.660
He's not a liar.

40:55.420 --> 40:57.240
I'm going to ask him myself.

40:57.280 --> 41:00.320
He promised he'd return after break.

41:00.360 --> 41:03.240
Why would he lie to me?

41:03.280 --> 41:05.620
Yingtao, Aunt Liang has settled

41:05.660 --> 41:07.100
her work matters now.

41:07.140 --> 41:09.100
She just wants to focus on raising Qiaoxi

41:09.140 --> 41:11.040
properly in the provincial capital.

41:22.240 --> 41:23.440
Well…

41:24.460 --> 41:26.000
Then next time…

41:26.540 --> 41:27.760
- Take care.
- Sure.

41:27.800 --> 41:28.880
Next time.

41:59.780 --> 42:01.140
Uncle Wang!

42:31.060 --> 42:31.940
Yingtao.

42:33.020 --> 42:34.380
Study hard.

42:36.100 --> 42:37.600
I mean

42:39.480 --> 42:41.080
grow up to be anything but me.

43:16.340 --> 43:18.480
- Jiang Qiaoxi!
- Jiang Qiaoxi!

43:18.520 --> 43:19.840
Jiang Qiaoxi!

43:21.120 --> 43:22.140
Jiang Qiaoxi!

43:27.380 --> 43:28.880
Jiang Qiaoxi!

43:28.920 --> 43:31.480
Jiang Qiaoxi, write to me.

43:31.520 --> 43:33.020
You must write to me.

43:33.060 --> 43:34.560
Yingtao!

43:34.600 --> 43:36.720
I'll be back after winter break!

43:36.760 --> 43:38.140
Yingtao!

43:38.180 --> 43:40.040
I'll be back after winter break!

43:47.480 --> 43:48.540
I know.

43:49.980 --> 43:51.440
No matter how brave I am,

43:52.980 --> 43:54.480
I'll never grow wings.

44:13.660 --> 44:14.900
Dad says

44:15.400 --> 44:16.420
living is like

44:16.920 --> 44:18.000
being a silkworm,

44:18.500 --> 44:20.380
a snake, or a crab.

44:21.640 --> 44:23.020
When the time comes,

44:23.060 --> 44:25.060
you must step out of the old shell.

44:25.560 --> 44:27.500
Only by forgetting certain things

44:27.540 --> 44:28.480
and moving on,

44:29.160 --> 44:30.760
you can travel light

44:31.400 --> 44:33.620
and live better.

47:02.400 --> 47:05.320
Subtitle translation by: Wanjiao Song
